<div class="section_content content" id="7678264_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The bonds to be given by the City officials hereinafter named shall be in the respective penalties hereby prescribed and specified in the schedule set forth in § <a class="xref" guid="7678265" href="7678265#7678265">18-2</a>.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
