<div class="section_content content" id="7678265_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The schedule of bond penalties shall be as follows:</div><div class="codeTable " style="border-color:"><table class=" frame frameNone"><colgroup><col style="width: 5%"></col><col style="width: 69%"></col><col style="width: 26%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" colspan="2" scope="col" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Officials</b></div></th><th align="center" charoff="50" class="entry" scope="col" startcol="3" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Penalty of Bond</b></div></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" colspan="3" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Department of Audit and Control</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="2" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">City Comptroller </div></td><td align="center" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="3" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$25,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="2" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">First Deputy Comptroller </div></td><td align="center" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="3" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$5,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="2" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Special Deputy Comptroller </div></td><td align="center" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="3" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$5,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="2" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Auditor </div></td><td align="center" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="3" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$10,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" colspan="3" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Department of Buildings</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="2" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Commissioner </div></td><td align="center" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="3" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$5,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="2" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Deputy Commissioner </div></td><td align="center" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="3" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">$5,000.00</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="2" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Elevator Inspector </div></td><td align="center" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="3" valign="top"><div cla