        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678266" data-guid="7678266"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678266" data-guid="7678266" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678266_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The surety on said bonds shall be a duly organized surety company authorized to do business in the State of New York, and the premium thereon, when approved by the Board of Estimate and Apportionment, shall be paid out of the City treasury.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678267"
      id="7678267"
      data-guid="7678267"
      data-position="212"
      data-full-title="§ 18-4: Collateral security."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
