        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678268" data-guid="7678268"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678268" data-guid="7678268" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678268_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Mayor shall be and he hereby is authorized to lease a box or compartment in the vault of the Albany Safe Deposit and Storage Company for the purpose of depositing therein the bonds executed by City officers and other bonds required by law or ordinance to be executed to the City of Albany, or any of its officers, to secure it or them from liability or damages.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

